(text "SECTION 1: R10=R11=9.15k, Cf=C2+C3=118n, Cg=C4=100n\nf0 = 160.125 Hz; Q = 0.54314\nSECTION 2: R12=R13=17.4k, Cf=C5=150n, Cg=C6=22n\nf0 = 159.226 Hz; Q = 1.30558" (at 20.32 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "955a32a0-8dc9-558f-b67d-ab076bdf57a9"))
(text "Nominal response (ideal amplifiers, before 100R/DAQ loading):\n3 Hz: 99.87X     50 Hz: 100.18X     100 Hz: 99.35X\n200 Hz: 37.65X   500 Hz: 1.04X     1 kHz: 0.065X\nValues approximate a fourth-order Butterworth response." (at 20.32 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "096d7f9c-d7bb-59e5-ac05-5dbed55ce713"))
(text "Build requirements:\n- No X7R/Y5V in the gain or filter signal capacitors.\n- Keep C2/C3 and C5 return paths at their own op-amp outputs.\n- Keep detector/feedback wiring away from relay coil and digital returns.\n- Confirm capacitive-load stability with the actual DAQ cable.\n- Calibrate each channel; calculated response is not a noise-floor test." (at 220.98 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb6d532c-72b3-5cc9-8931-acf973884a98"))
(text "For 50 channels: 150 active amplifier sections = 38 OPA4192 quads total.\nExisting 13 quads can supply the 50 gain stages; 25 more quads supply\nthe 100 filter stages. This drawing is a one-channel reference, not a\ncompleted 50-channel PCB or harness drawing." (at 220.98 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8885a3d7-2fed-5aec-9c99-8eaa8d05c832"))
)
